book.hint.guest_333
* The quiet guest at 3:33 always orders the same.

book.hint.grandma_card
* Grandma left a card for this one.

book.hint.pantry
* Try the pantry. Something blue, perhaps.

book.hint.lviv_parcel
* Something that might arrive in a parcel from Lviv.

book.gated.r_kulajda
