# --- experiments ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
experiment.known
* You know this one: {recipe}.

experiment.discovered
* Discovered! {recipe}

experiment.close.swap
* So close — swap the {family} one.

experiment.close.extra
* Almost — one thing too many.

experiment.close.missing
* Almost — it wants something {family}.

experiment.cat_sniffs
* The cat sniffs it, thinks about it, and walks away.

experiment.nothing.1
* It's… drinkable. Kuba drank it anyway.

experiment.nothing.2
* Interesting. In the way a puddle is interesting.

experiment.nothing.3
* That's a flavour. Not a good one, but a flavour.

experiment.nothing.4
* Grandma would have said "brave". Grandma was being kind.

experiment.nothing.5
* Into the sink it goes. Nobody saw.

experiment.nothing.6
* Not a recipe yet. Maybe a story for later.
